*Design:*
  Guardian ("Who's skating?"): add one or more skaters, each with their full name, "Under 18?" yes or no, skating
    organization and number. "Add another skater" adds more. Each added skater can be removed.
    "Send to Coach <name>" is disabled until at least one skater is added.
