Step 5, Waiting for approval:
"You're in", signed in, with each skater listed as waiting for the coach's approval.
Booking opens for each skater once the coach approves them. No email is sent (Phase 2; see "Coach approval" below).
"Go to my account" button. While waiting, the family sees only Home and Profile (ADR-022 d6, see ClientHomeView).

Coach approval:
  *Decided by the owner 2026-10-09, answering Items to ask Kim About.md §6 questions 2 and 4.* The coach approves
    everyone, siblings included: a skater a family adds later waits for approval like any new student, however
    well the coach knows the family.
  No reminder email for waiting approvals. Instead the coach website's Students tab shows the number of pending
    students in its title. *(from ADR-002, amendment 2026-10-09, moved 2026-11-08)*
  *Decided by the owner 2026-11-06, settling a conflict with the Harbor design (design/harbor/client/screens-account.js,
    which promised "We'll email you as soon as Coach Dana approves" in six places):* the email telling a family their
